Package: vabaxos-apps
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, packagekit (>= 1.3.4), flatpak
Description: VabaxOS Programs: start at login and remove, in one list
 Every installed application with a switch to start it at login and a
 button to remove it (Flatpak or Debian package, through PackageKit), like
 Apps in the Windows 11 Settings, readable with Orca. Programs VabaxOS
 needs to speak and work cannot be removed there. It also installs
 Bottles, for Windows programs, from Flathub on request.
